# SWR-006 W8 — bot simulations, calibration, difficulty metrics (backend-worker Rules/AI, 2026-11-19)
# Harness: packages/games/rebellion/test/ai/sim/harness.ts — createRebellionServerModule() (production module, bot policy) +
# its `automation`, exactly like the server runner with the `bot` strategy: pendingActor → decisionPoint (validated with
# AutomationDecisionPointSchema) → fallbackCandidateId → applyCandidate({ now }); one run per human command, bounded by 64 steps.
# Human seat: module.applyCommand (origin 'player') with scripts E-PASSIVE, E-HUNT (full-knowledge oracle), R-PASSIVE, R-ACTIVE,
# or the bot itself (bot-vs-bot). Seeds: DIFF_SEEDS swr006-d01..d20, PROP_SEEDS swr006-p01..p30 (frozen, test/ai/sim/seeds.ts).
# Thresholds: test-cases.md §7/§10 (frozen, Q-3) — not changed; TC-DIF-07 counted before the reveal only (Analyst decision).

